       "text_offset_after_ms": 575.6
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 68,
       "text": "so I cannot tell you the exact duration of this particular exchange.",
       "duration_s": 3.68,
       "arrived_ms": 12173.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 12634.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 460.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 11883.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 159,
       "text": "The system\u2019s test runs on this machine, however, record that from the moment you finish speaking to my first spoken word takes roughly six to thirteen seconds.",
       "duration_s": 9.36,
       "arrived_ms": 15772.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 16314.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 541.9,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 8203.6,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 133,
       "text": "That figure is a general benchmark; it does not reflect any specific network delay, because this conversation remains entirely local.",
       "duration_s": 7.76,
       "arrived_ms": 18947.7,
       "playback_start_ms": 25674.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 6726.3,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -1156.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 42,
       "text": "Your connection is therefore not a factor.",
       "duration_s": 2.4,
       "arrived_ms": 20455.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 33434.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 12978.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -8916.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 194,
       "text": "All of the audio and text processing occurs on this Mac, with no data leaving the machine, so any latency is due to the local processing pipeline rather than external bandwidth or network speed.",
       "duration_s": 10.08,
       "arrived_ms": 24373.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 35834.0,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 11460.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -11316.4,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "phrase": "What would it take for you to answer me within a second?",
     "speech_end_to": {
      "endpoint_seen": 908.2,
      "words_provisional_after": 908.2,
      "committed_seen": 2137.6,
      "owner_message_canonical": 2149.1,
      "answered_seen": 18212.2,
      "answer_read_via_answered": 18222.7,
      "turn_appended": 59774.7,
      "answer_read_via_turn": 59785.0,
      "first_playback_start": 15724.5
     },
     "segments": [
      {
       "index": 1,
       "chars": 172,
       "text": "My lord,\n\nTo bring the first spoken word within a single second after you finish speaking would require changes at several levels of the system that presently do not exist:",
       "duration_s": 9.44,
       "arrived_ms": 15724.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 15724.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": null,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 44060.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 2498.2
      },
      {
       "index": 2,
       "chars": 110,
       "text": "1. **Hardware acceleration** \u2013 The current inference runs on a single\u2011core CPU with the full model weight set.",
       "duration_s": 7.12,
       "arrived_ms": 19823.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 25164.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 5340.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 34620.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 3,
       "chars": 98,
       "text": "Even with a GPU or specialised ASIC, the time to load and process an utterance is several seconds.",
       "duration_s": 6.0,
       "arrived_ms": 22498.5,
       "playback_start_ms": 32284.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 9785.9,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 27500.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 4,
       "chars": 123,
       "text": "A dedicated inference accelerator that can pre\u2011warm the model and deliver a forward pass in under 0.5\u202fs would be necessary.",
       "duration_s": 7.76,
       "arrived_ms": 25681.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 38284.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 12602.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 21500.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 5,
       "chars": 134,
       "text": "2. **Model size and optimisation** \u2013 The present model weighs many megabytes and performs a large\u2011scale attention pass for each token.",
       "duration_s": 8.64,
       "arrived_ms": 29105.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 46044.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 16938.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 13740.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 6,
       "chars": 201,
       "text": "Reducing the model size (e.g., via quantisation or pruning) and simplifying the attention pattern would cut inference time dramatically, but at a cost to precision that must be acceptable to the house.",
       "duration_s": 10.96,
       "arrived_ms": 33271.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 54684.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 21412.6,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": 5100.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 7,
       "chars": 129,
       "text": "3. **Audio\u2011to\u2011text pipeline** \u2013 The Whisper recogniser presently takes about 1\u20132\u202fs to transcribe the final few seconds of speech.",
       "duration_s": 8.24,
       "arrived_ms": 36514.0,
       "playback_start_ms": 65644.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 29130.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -5859.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 8,
       "chars": 160,
       "text": "A faster recogniser, or a pipeline that can stream partial transcripts and trigger the response earlier, would shave several hundred milliseconds off the total.",
       "duration_s": 8.24,
       "arrived_ms": 39860.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 73884.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 34024.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -14099.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 9,
       "chars": 125,
       "text": "4. **Response\u2011to\u2011voice conversion** \u2013 The current TTS synthesis takes a fraction of a second, but it is only the final stage.",
       "duration_s": 8.24,
       "arrived_ms": 43193.9,
       "playback_start_ms": 82124.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 38930.5,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -22339.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 10,
       "chars": 120,
       "text": "Streamlining this step and ensuring the synthesiser can start output as soon as the first token is generated would help.",
       "duration_s": 6.08,
       "arrived_ms": 45863.8,
       "playback_start_ms": 90364.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 44500.7,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -30579.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 11,
       "chars": 174,
       "text": "5. **System load and scheduling** \u2013 Even with all of the above optimisations, if other tasks are queued on the same machine, the system may still incur context\u2011switch delays.",
       "duration_s": 10.96,
       "arrived_ms": 50025.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 96444.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 46419.3,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -36659.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 12,
       "chars": 60,
       "text": "Dedicated resources for this conversation would be required.",
       "duration_s": 3.36,
       "arrived_ms": 51773.4,
       "playback_start_ms": 107404.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 55631.1,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -47619.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 13,
       "chars": 205,
       "text": "In short, achieving a sub\u2011second turnaround would demand both faster hardware and more aggressive model optimisation, along with a system that can start synthesising as soon as the first token is produced.",
       "duration_s": 11.04,
       "arrived_ms": 55937.1,
       "playback_start_ms": 110764.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 54827.4,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -50979.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      },
      {
       "index": 14,
       "chars": 173,
       "text": "Presently, the measured path from your silence to my first spoken phrase averages 6\u201313\u202fs on this machine, and we cannot promise a different figure without the changes above.",
       "duration_s": 9.44,
       "arrived_ms": 59671.6,
       "playback_start_ms": 121804.5,
       "waited_for_previous_ms": 62132.8,
       "gap_after_previous_ms": 0.0,
       "text_offset_before_ms": -62019.5,
       "text_offset_after_ms": 0.0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
